WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:14.560
♪Trapped in this tiny world♪

00:15.040 --> 00:18.440
♪I'm crushed into dust♪

00:19.200 --> 00:23.000
♪I meddle around without any mercy♪

00:23.320 --> 00:26.160
♪I'm my own pawn♪

00:26.520 --> 00:30.360
♪I sigh at my fate♪

00:30.560 --> 00:35.360
♪Numerous people are under my control♪

00:38.040 --> 00:41.880
♪All the sand is washed away♪

00:44.280 --> 00:47.880
♪An old dream fades♪

00:50.200 --> 00:54.560
♪A bumpy path lies ahead♪

00:56.040 --> 00:58.880
♪Traps within traps,
I never make mistakes♪

00:59.200 --> 01:02.000
♪I take a risk at every step♪

01:02.280 --> 01:07.400
♪Even in disputes,
I break through with my life♪

01:07.880 --> 01:10.280
♪Schemes within schemes,
I prison myself♪

01:10.520 --> 01:13.600
♪Each link swaps bluff and truth♪

01:13.920 --> 01:16.480
♪The world is my Weiqi game board♪

01:16.800 --> 01:22.120
♪Everything's just fleeting♪

01:23.720 --> 01:28.320
♪The play begins♪

01:30.280 --> 01:32.520
♪No return is expected♪

01:32.880 --> 01:37.880
♪The flame is gone,
whether we win or lose♪

01:38.280 --> 01:40.360
♪The wind never ceases.
I hold the reins♪

01:40.360 --> 01:41.480
[Ashes To Crown]

01:41.480 --> 01:45.680
[Adapted from Xixing's novel,
Empress of the State of Chu]

01:46.470 --> 01:49.000
[Episode 4]

01:49.860 --> 01:51.940
I had calculated every move,

01:53.580 --> 01:55.980
yet the one I held dearest
threw it all into ruin.

01:56.700 --> 01:57.860
Had she not interfered,

01:58.260 --> 01:59.700
we'd never have endured
such indignity.

02:01.700 --> 02:02.140
No.

02:03.980 --> 02:05.060
I should thank her

02:07.260 --> 02:09.020
for making one thing clear.

02:11.180 --> 02:12.620
Even the most masterful stratagem

02:13.820 --> 02:14.900
cannot withstand

02:14.900 --> 02:16.380
a sudden turn of fortune.

02:19.500 --> 02:21.340
Just like this game,

02:21.780 --> 02:23.700
I thought victory was all but assured,

02:24.260 --> 02:25.180
and yet I forgot

02:26.140 --> 02:27.100
that the opponent

02:28.300 --> 02:30.140
does not always play by your script.

02:32.540 --> 02:33.620
I had accounted for everyone,

02:33.980 --> 02:35.940
except her.

02:37.660 --> 02:39.140
Who would have thought

02:39.580 --> 02:41.140
that the little girl

02:41.180 --> 02:42.580
who once wept in public

02:43.500 --> 02:44.100
would dare

02:45.460 --> 02:47.780
to take the pieces in hand
amid such chaos?

02:51.540 --> 02:52.340
But

02:53.300 --> 02:54.180
one such mistake

02:55.180 --> 02:56.140
is all it takes.

03:21.220 --> 03:23.900
Your Majesty,
please accept the offering.

03:26.500 --> 03:30.220
The Divine Bird descends to the shrine

03:30.740 --> 03:34.500
as ancestral might protects the land.

03:35.300 --> 03:39.260
The divine aura soars
like swirling clouds,

03:40.260 --> 03:44.620
bestowing grace to nourish the realm.

03:56.820 --> 03:58.300
Chu Zhao has put Deng Yi and Xie Yanfang

03:58.460 --> 04:00.020
in charge of all ancestral rites,

04:00.500 --> 04:01.300
even the shamans' invocations

04:01.340 --> 04:02.100
included.

04:02.340 --> 04:03.540
Will this compromise our plan?

04:04.100 --> 04:05.180
Tomorrow,

04:05.660 --> 04:07.220
once the herbs are lit,

04:08.660 --> 04:10.820
Xiao Yu, standing nearest to the censer,

04:11.500 --> 04:12.500
will inhale

04:16.060 --> 04:17.180
the poisoned smoke.

04:18.580 --> 04:21.100
She will surely guard
against every possibility.

04:22.340 --> 04:23.060
Yet

04:24.300 --> 04:25.660
once the smoke rises,

04:27.820 --> 04:29.660
her days as Grand Princess

04:31.620 --> 04:33.020
are over.

04:35.540 --> 04:36.900
What's wrong?

04:37.900 --> 04:38.380
Yu.

04:40.700 --> 04:42.020
Yu.

04:42.460 --> 04:42.980
Yu.

04:43.660 --> 04:44.220
Yu!

04:44.660 --> 04:45.380
Are you alright?

04:45.380 --> 04:45.780
Your Majesty.

04:45.980 --> 04:46.620
- Your Majesty. - Yu.

04:46.620 --> 04:47.940
- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.

04:48.260 --> 04:48.940
Wake up.

04:49.260 --> 04:49.780
Yu.

04:51.340 --> 04:53.260
Dark omens shadow the throne

04:53.660 --> 04:55.260
as the Grand Princess's fate...

04:55.340 --> 04:55.940
Yu.

04:55.940 --> 04:57.660
Collides with the Emperor's.

04:58.460 --> 04:58.980
Wake up.

04:58.980 --> 05:02.340
It is as if the heavens seek
to sever the imperial lifeline!

05:03.060 --> 05:05.220
The Grand Princess has plotted
against His Majesty.

05:05.580 --> 05:06.820
Seize her at once!

05:10.940 --> 05:11.980
Whoever dares to touch Her Highness

05:12.740 --> 05:13.700
answers to my blade.

05:14.060 --> 05:15.060
How insolent you are

05:15.500 --> 05:17.180
to draw steel before His Majesty!

05:18.260 --> 05:19.300
None shall presume!

05:20.260 --> 05:20.940
Summon the Imperial Physician

05:21.740 --> 05:22.580
to tend to His Majesty.

05:24.140 --> 05:24.940
Seal the palace gates.

05:25.300 --> 05:26.100
None shall leave

05:26.700 --> 05:28.060
without express command.

06:04.820 --> 06:05.700
Mr. Deng,

06:06.020 --> 06:07.140
please forgive me.

06:07.380 --> 06:08.860
His Majesty's pulse

06:08.940 --> 06:10.100
shows no irregularity.

06:10.380 --> 06:11.860
Then why does he remain unconscious?

06:12.500 --> 06:13.740
I cannot find the cause.

06:14.620 --> 06:16.020
But His Majesty's condition,

06:16.140 --> 06:17.260
falling unconscious

06:17.500 --> 06:18.740
after inhaling the smoke,

06:18.820 --> 06:19.900
is strikingly similar

06:19.940 --> 06:21.020
to the Crown Prince's poisoning.

06:21.060 --> 06:22.020
Have you identified the toxin?

06:22.340 --> 06:23.580
The Crown Prince's death

06:23.580 --> 06:24.900
was never truly probed in time,

06:25.060 --> 06:27.140
so the source remains a mystery.

06:27.300 --> 06:27.980
Keep digging.

06:28.100 --> 06:28.660
Yes.

06:32.700 --> 06:34.100
What should we do?

06:34.660 --> 06:36.460
Everyone involved in the poisoning

06:37.140 --> 06:38.620
is right here.

06:40.980 --> 06:42.580
Why not ask them outright?

06:48.540 --> 06:49.340
How is His Majesty?

06:56.180 --> 06:57.500
What is the condition? I must go in.

06:57.620 --> 06:58.900
His Majesty is being attended to.

06:59.460 --> 07:01.060
No one is permitted to enter.

07:01.540 --> 07:02.060
Your Highness.

07:02.420 --> 07:03.540
By law,

07:03.980 --> 07:05.900
the implicated
must be held for questioning.

07:06.540 --> 07:08.060
Leaving your palace unbidden now

07:08.460 --> 07:09.460
will only make things

07:10.300 --> 07:11.300
harder to resolve.

07:12.260 --> 07:13.300
It wasn't me.

07:16.100 --> 07:17.340
What has become of Yu?

07:22.540 --> 07:23.700
He has yet to awaken.

07:24.420 --> 07:25.420
Acupuncture and herbs

07:26.100 --> 07:26.740
have been administered.

07:29.140 --> 07:29.460
What...?

07:29.500 --> 07:31.540
Yet when His Majesty was poisoned,

07:32.740 --> 07:33.580
you were the only one

07:34.900 --> 07:35.820
by his side.

07:36.180 --> 07:36.660
Zhao.

07:41.380 --> 07:42.620
The Imperial Physician said

07:43.260 --> 07:44.580
his symptoms

07:44.660 --> 07:46.980
are identical to those of his father.

07:48.100 --> 07:48.660
Mr. Xiao,

07:49.740 --> 07:51.740
do you know what poison
His Majesty took?

07:55.860 --> 07:57.180
How strange you should ask.

07:58.340 --> 07:59.620
Given it was

07:59.980 --> 08:01.300
the Third Prince's doing,

08:02.060 --> 08:03.140
how should I know?

08:04.340 --> 08:06.380
The shaman

08:07.540 --> 08:09.060
has branded her a jinx.

08:09.540 --> 08:10.940
I was skeptical at first.

08:11.660 --> 08:13.180
But with His Majesty at death's door,

08:13.580 --> 08:14.500
rather than pursuing

08:14.540 --> 08:15.420
the true culprit,

08:15.980 --> 08:17.140
you stand here questioning me?

08:17.980 --> 08:18.660
Xiao Xun,

08:19.380 --> 08:20.860
I am the Grand Princess,

08:21.100 --> 08:22.260
not some jinx you claimed.

08:22.260 --> 08:22.860
Very well.

08:24.060 --> 08:25.500
Perhaps you find me

08:25.500 --> 08:26.860
an eyesore

08:27.300 --> 08:28.660
and wish to pin the blame on me

08:29.220 --> 08:30.460
just to have me out of the way.

08:30.580 --> 08:32.060
Nonsense.

08:32.380 --> 08:33.980
Your Highness has quite the nerve,

08:34.540 --> 08:35.300
pinning

08:35.380 --> 08:36.420
this atrocity on me

08:36.460 --> 08:37.100
without any proof.

08:37.780 --> 08:38.860
This is outrageous.

08:39.140 --> 08:40.180
Your Highness is the one

08:40.860 --> 08:42.020
who owes an answer

08:42.020 --> 08:42.660
for this.

08:42.820 --> 08:43.660
The shaman

08:44.220 --> 08:45.180
has divined an ill omen.

08:45.380 --> 08:46.100
Your Highness

08:46.380 --> 08:47.860
ought not to remain here any longer.

08:49.940 --> 08:51.620
If Your Highness has nothing to hide,

08:52.100 --> 08:53.700
you might as well step aside

08:54.220 --> 08:55.820
and let the truth run its course.

08:56.620 --> 08:57.340
Indeed.

08:57.860 --> 08:59.580
- That's right. - Yes.

09:00.540 --> 09:01.100
Enough.

09:01.580 --> 09:02.900
Everyone, calm yourselves.

09:03.380 --> 09:04.660
Something is amiss here.

09:05.700 --> 09:07.380
It concerns the stability of the realm.

09:08.140 --> 09:09.980
Please remain in your palace

09:10.620 --> 09:12.540
until the truth

09:13.100 --> 09:13.980
comes to light.

09:15.780 --> 09:16.340
Someone.

09:16.460 --> 09:16.980
I'll do it.

09:40.780 --> 09:43.500
His Majesty requires rest,

09:44.100 --> 09:45.980
and I shall not disturb further.

09:47.020 --> 09:47.460
I shall depart.

09:52.260 --> 09:53.020
We should leave too.

09:53.220 --> 09:54.380
- Let's go. - Let's go.

09:55.580 --> 09:56.340
His Majesty needs rest.

09:56.660 --> 09:58.580
What a scene.

10:01.140 --> 10:03.260
You seem unbothered leaving your brother

10:05.900 --> 10:07.580
to keep watch over her.

10:07.740 --> 10:08.740
If you're worried,

10:10.220 --> 10:11.780
you can take his place.

10:15.260 --> 10:16.500
- That's right. - It has been a while.

10:16.860 --> 10:18.500
When will His Majesty wake?

10:31.340 --> 10:31.860
Jiu,

10:32.460 --> 10:33.340
stay here and keep watch.

10:33.700 --> 10:34.500
I will go find Yu.

10:36.460 --> 10:36.740
Alright.

10:36.820 --> 10:37.620
I have already briefed

10:37.620 --> 10:38.420
the guards at his door.

11:01.300 --> 11:01.820
Yu,

11:02.060 --> 11:02.620
wake up.

11:03.580 --> 11:04.340
It's alright.

11:08.340 --> 11:08.820
Zhao,

11:09.380 --> 11:10.300
how was my performance?

11:10.660 --> 11:11.740
I even fooled the Imperial Physician.

11:13.180 --> 11:14.340
Once you have had your pastries,

11:14.820 --> 11:15.500
the physician

11:15.580 --> 11:16.900
will report that you have come to.

11:17.820 --> 11:19.100
You must keep it up a while longer.

11:21.500 --> 11:22.260
I'm sorry.

11:23.660 --> 11:24.340
Don't be.

11:24.740 --> 11:26.340
We are catching the villain together.

11:26.780 --> 11:28.540
I can play my part.

11:31.460 --> 11:32.740
But if something goes wrong,

11:36.060 --> 11:37.140
you could be in danger.

11:37.980 --> 11:39.020
You risked your life

11:39.420 --> 11:40.820
to save me among the rebels.

11:41.220 --> 11:42.020
I trust

11:42.500 --> 11:43.500
you will keep me safe.

11:44.420 --> 11:45.020
Rest easy.

11:45.780 --> 11:46.580
It will not be long

11:47.340 --> 11:48.300
before I catch

11:48.340 --> 11:49.020
the culprit.

11:49.380 --> 11:49.740
And

11:50.180 --> 11:50.900
once this is over,

11:51.020 --> 11:52.220
remember to build me

11:52.620 --> 11:53.660
a grand swing.

11:59.980 --> 12:01.580
I promise I will.

12:06.460 --> 12:07.020
Your Highness.

12:07.900 --> 12:08.460
What is it?

12:10.020 --> 12:11.060
Word has come

12:11.820 --> 12:12.580
His Majesty is awake.

12:14.740 --> 12:15.420
Impossible.

12:16.940 --> 12:17.780
Golden Finch Venom

12:18.100 --> 12:18.900
has no antidote.

12:19.660 --> 12:20.860
How could they have cured him?

12:21.180 --> 12:21.860
The Imperial Physician says

12:22.300 --> 12:23.260
the two toxins

12:23.460 --> 12:24.220
are identical.

12:24.700 --> 12:26.020
That poison is ours alone.

12:26.540 --> 12:27.060
Is it possible

12:27.060 --> 12:27.980
they'd link it to us?

12:28.820 --> 12:30.500
There is no hard evidence.

12:31.140 --> 12:32.060
Do not lose your nerve.

12:33.260 --> 12:33.700
Go

12:34.500 --> 12:35.340
investigate.

12:36.460 --> 12:37.420
The Emperor's guards

12:37.460 --> 12:38.620
have been replaced by Xie Yanlai

12:39.460 --> 12:40.340
and reinforced.

12:40.660 --> 12:41.340
Deng Yi has ordered

12:41.820 --> 12:42.900
that no one is to visit.

12:46.060 --> 12:46.820
No one?

13:12.140 --> 13:13.820
As his uncle,

13:14.780 --> 13:16.420
I should call upon him.

13:31.180 --> 13:33.700
Concerned for His Majesty, I've come

13:34.140 --> 13:34.940
to pay my respects.

13:36.740 --> 13:38.380
Please wait. Mr. Deng ordered

13:38.500 --> 13:40.140
that all visitors

13:40.180 --> 13:41.500
must first go through him.

13:42.100 --> 13:43.700
His Majesty and I

13:44.580 --> 13:45.980
are of the same lineage.

13:46.660 --> 13:48.140
Does that count for nothing here?

13:48.540 --> 13:49.820
It is so grave

13:50.060 --> 13:51.220
that we have to stay on guard.

13:51.580 --> 13:52.380
Please understand. Your Highness.

13:52.620 --> 13:53.780
Against the culprit,

13:54.340 --> 13:55.740
or me?

13:55.900 --> 13:56.980
What is it

13:58.620 --> 14:00.300
that has displeased you so?

14:01.580 --> 14:02.660
Is the medicine ready?

14:08.860 --> 14:10.180
Don't be so rigid.

14:10.940 --> 14:11.980
He is only worried

14:11.980 --> 14:12.900
about His Majesty.

14:13.740 --> 14:14.660
Let him through.

14:15.220 --> 14:15.620
But...

14:15.700 --> 14:16.220
What?

14:18.380 --> 14:19.660
My word is just as valid

14:20.820 --> 14:21.780
as Mr. Deng's.

14:25.020 --> 14:26.620
There is no need for such a temper.

14:27.260 --> 14:28.940
They are merely following orders.

14:29.940 --> 14:30.540
Please follow me.

14:46.540 --> 14:46.980
Your Majesty.

14:51.500 --> 14:52.820
It has been but a few days,

14:54.420 --> 14:55.660
yet you've grown so frail.

14:55.900 --> 14:56.420
Your Highness,

14:57.700 --> 14:59.060
I am afraid this is not proper.

15:06.620 --> 15:08.420
The poison
is indeed difficult to counter.

15:09.060 --> 15:09.940
Fortunately, His Majesty

15:10.020 --> 15:11.180
is blessed,

15:11.980 --> 15:12.740
and Her Highness

15:12.780 --> 15:13.700
has found the antidote.

15:15.580 --> 15:17.140
The remedy is complex, however,

15:18.060 --> 15:19.540
and must be taken for nine days

15:19.900 --> 15:20.820
before it takes effect.

15:23.740 --> 15:25.940
Then give His Majesty the medicine

15:26.540 --> 15:27.300
at once.

15:29.460 --> 15:30.420
By Mr. Deng's command,

15:30.900 --> 15:32.380
you two lords must depart immediately.

15:33.540 --> 15:34.340
Presumptuous.

15:43.060 --> 15:44.300
I'm here to call on His Majesty.

15:44.580 --> 15:45.660
Who is he to interfere?

16:03.620 --> 16:04.580
How did you know

16:05.140 --> 16:06.460
that the poison he used at the ritual

16:07.500 --> 16:08.220
was the same one

16:08.260 --> 16:09.300
that killed the Crown Prince?

16:09.700 --> 16:10.340
I didn't.

16:10.860 --> 16:11.340
You didn't?

16:12.380 --> 16:12.980
Then

16:13.020 --> 16:14.220
why did you tell him

16:14.220 --> 16:14.820
Yu had awakened?

16:16.060 --> 16:16.940
I was baiting him.

16:18.260 --> 16:19.700
Moving against Yu

16:20.420 --> 16:21.380
proves

16:21.980 --> 16:23.340
he killed the Crown Prince, too.

16:24.380 --> 16:25.100
You were using

16:26.620 --> 16:27.940
His Majesty as bait.

16:38.020 --> 16:38.980
That is why I needed you

16:40.100 --> 16:41.500
in the shadows.

16:42.180 --> 16:43.780
To catch him

16:45.580 --> 16:46.740
red-handed

16:47.900 --> 16:49.220
when the time comes.

16:54.100 --> 16:55.180
But what if he does not come?

16:58.380 --> 16:59.580
Your brother will help.

17:04.620 --> 17:06.580
He has seen my devotion

17:07.180 --> 17:08.220
to Yu.

17:09.980 --> 17:11.020
He will assist me.

17:17.820 --> 17:18.540
Why are you so set

17:18.540 --> 17:19.740
on sending Xiao Xun to his grave?

17:20.060 --> 17:21.180
Because he deserves no less.

17:26.660 --> 17:27.420
If you make a mistake...

17:27.420 --> 17:28.060
Then ensure

17:28.100 --> 17:29.660
no such thing happens.

17:53.940 --> 17:55.660
Xiao Xun, what do you think
you are doing?

18:00.540 --> 18:00.940
Yu.

18:01.380 --> 18:01.820
Yu.

18:02.420 --> 18:02.940
Yu.

18:05.660 --> 18:06.140
Yu.

18:08.700 --> 18:09.100
Yu.

18:09.540 --> 18:10.020
Yu.

18:11.260 --> 18:11.660
Yu.

18:15.420 --> 18:16.140
Zhao.

18:17.260 --> 18:18.180
I am fine.

18:19.300 --> 18:21.060
I just fell asleep.

18:48.740 --> 18:50.220
Xiao Xun, heir to the Lord of Xiaonan,

18:50.780 --> 18:52.260
attempted to poison the Emperor.

18:52.660 --> 18:53.700
This crime is unforgivable.

18:57.860 --> 18:58.580
With nothing

18:59.100 --> 18:59.860
but bare words,

19:00.900 --> 19:01.940
Your Highness would charge me

19:02.460 --> 19:03.300
with poisoning?

19:03.860 --> 19:04.540
What's your proof?

19:05.260 --> 19:05.940
Summon the Imperial Physician.

19:06.340 --> 19:06.860
Test the medicine.

19:07.380 --> 19:08.220
Summon the Imperial Physician.

19:51.020 --> 19:52.260
Your Highness,

19:52.460 --> 19:53.100
Mr. Deng,

19:53.460 --> 19:54.340
it's

19:54.820 --> 19:55.660
non-toxic.

19:56.140 --> 19:56.820
Impossible.

20:08.020 --> 20:09.220
I saw him do it.

20:22.980 --> 20:23.860
Zhao,

20:24.860 --> 20:27.820
your little trap

20:28.900 --> 20:30.580
was far too rushed.

20:30.980 --> 20:32.060
In that case,

20:32.660 --> 20:34.300
I'll prepare a gift for you.

20:34.900 --> 20:35.380
What?

20:36.220 --> 20:36.740
A trap?

20:37.180 --> 20:38.020
Golden Finch Venom

20:38.660 --> 20:39.900
has no antidote.

20:40.180 --> 20:41.140
And after the coup

20:42.300 --> 20:43.140
that day,

20:44.140 --> 20:45.180
no one ever examined

20:46.900 --> 20:48.340
the Crown Prince's body.

20:49.780 --> 20:50.420
So

20:52.060 --> 20:52.900
the news

20:54.020 --> 20:55.140
must be false.

20:57.420 --> 20:58.100
Have the Imperial Physician

20:58.820 --> 21:00.180
decant a calming draft

21:01.380 --> 21:02.180
into this vial.

21:08.580 --> 21:09.620
Your Highness is clearly

21:10.500 --> 21:11.500
the prime suspect

21:11.580 --> 21:12.900
for the poisoning.

21:13.300 --> 21:15.900
Yet you're framing me

21:16.500 --> 21:17.220
for

21:17.820 --> 21:18.820
regicide.

21:19.460 --> 21:20.540
So, you must be certain

21:21.260 --> 21:22.940
I tainted this tonic.

21:23.540 --> 21:24.940
And yet,

21:25.260 --> 21:27.540
you left me alone with His Majesty.

21:28.220 --> 21:29.260
What

21:29.900 --> 21:30.700
is your true intent?

21:30.860 --> 21:31.820
Have you no regard

21:31.900 --> 21:32.980
for His Majesty's life?

21:33.980 --> 21:34.500
Exactly.

21:34.620 --> 21:35.140
Indeed.

21:40.420 --> 21:41.100
We shared

21:42.220 --> 21:45.540
a deep bond for many years.

21:46.860 --> 21:47.900
Even when our betrothal ended,

21:48.980 --> 21:49.940
I knew

21:50.460 --> 21:51.420
feelings

21:52.060 --> 21:52.980
cannot be swayed.

21:55.620 --> 21:56.300
Yet,

21:56.780 --> 21:57.500
to my dismay,

21:59.660 --> 22:00.300
you spurn

22:01.500 --> 22:03.180
our past

22:04.460 --> 22:05.900
and seek my very life.

22:07.300 --> 22:09.180
Whatever our grievances,

22:10.140 --> 22:11.780
you had no right to use His Majesty

22:12.340 --> 22:13.380
as a bait to frame me.

22:14.220 --> 22:15.060
Such treachery

22:15.500 --> 22:16.380
is unforgivable.

22:17.300 --> 22:18.300
Your Highness,

22:18.740 --> 22:19.740
how

22:20.140 --> 22:21.940
could you be so reckless?

22:22.260 --> 22:23.500
The Emperor's life is sacred,

22:23.740 --> 22:24.900
not a pawn for you to manipulate

22:24.940 --> 22:25.700
at will.

22:26.180 --> 22:27.460
Should any harm befall him,

22:27.740 --> 22:29.460
even death
could not atone for your guilt.

22:29.700 --> 22:30.180
Indeed.

22:30.900 --> 22:32.060
We cannot allow

22:32.100 --> 22:35.100
such a treacherous villain
to corrupt this court.

22:35.380 --> 22:37.700
Bearing a title of national honor,

22:38.100 --> 22:39.340
yet you are devious

22:39.460 --> 22:40.380
and ruthless.

22:40.580 --> 22:42.460
If this goes unpunished,

22:42.940 --> 22:44.300
where is the sanctity of our laws?

22:44.540 --> 22:45.900
Where is the integrity of this court?

22:46.500 --> 22:49.980
And how can we face the late Emperor?

22:52.260 --> 22:53.900
Save your breath.

22:54.500 --> 22:56.020
The truth is plain as day to you.

22:56.140 --> 22:56.620
Bring her in.

23:18.620 --> 23:19.260
No wonder

23:19.260 --> 23:20.700
Yu's been haunted in dreams lately.

23:21.100 --> 23:22.820
Turns out someone's been playing tricks.

23:33.860 --> 23:34.340
Your Majesty.

23:34.780 --> 23:35.420
- Zhao! - Your Majesty.

23:35.580 --> 23:36.060
What's the matter?

23:36.300 --> 23:36.980
- Zhao! - Your Majesty.

23:38.020 --> 23:38.540
Your Majesty.

23:40.140 --> 23:40.580
Yu.

23:41.380 --> 23:41.780
Yu.

23:42.020 --> 23:42.420
Come here.

23:43.700 --> 23:44.140
What's wrong?

23:45.420 --> 23:46.020
What happened?

23:46.380 --> 23:46.980
Your Highness,

23:47.300 --> 23:48.860
His Majesty has been waking
from nightmares for nights.

23:49.140 --> 23:50.220
Even the calming soup

23:50.300 --> 23:51.100
is all in vain.

23:52.340 --> 23:52.980
Zhao,

23:53.340 --> 23:53.980
I'm scared.

24:04.180 --> 24:04.980
It's no nightmare.

24:08.420 --> 24:09.020
Any new dishes

24:09.100 --> 24:10.020
on his table lately?

24:10.580 --> 24:11.300
Or any new ornaments

24:11.420 --> 24:12.300
placed here?

24:12.700 --> 24:13.420
The food is the same.

24:13.820 --> 24:14.860
But many tributes

24:14.940 --> 24:15.820
and new pieces have been brought in.

24:16.020 --> 24:16.540
Check them.

24:16.940 --> 24:17.300
Yes.

24:23.940 --> 24:24.580
There, there.

24:25.260 --> 24:26.380
I'm here.

24:29.660 --> 24:30.980
I saw candles flickering within,

24:31.660 --> 24:32.180
shadows rushing about.

24:32.580 --> 24:33.220
What has happened?

24:33.940 --> 24:34.660
The air

24:35.420 --> 24:36.580
reeks of foul play.

24:47.220 --> 24:48.140
This incense...

24:56.820 --> 24:57.340
Let me.

25:13.460 --> 25:14.540
Calming incense

25:16.100 --> 25:17.100
should be fine as dust,

25:17.700 --> 25:18.500
completely pure.

25:19.660 --> 25:20.420
Yet this is

25:21.700 --> 25:23.340
laced with grit.

25:24.220 --> 25:24.820
It seems

25:25.660 --> 25:27.060
someone is trying to poison the air.

25:28.140 --> 25:28.740
The toxins

25:29.340 --> 25:30.300
vanish with the smoke,

25:30.660 --> 25:32.260
destroying the evidence as it burns.

25:33.420 --> 25:34.100
This is

25:35.020 --> 25:36.220
the same way that killed

25:37.220 --> 25:37.940
the Crown Prince.

25:39.740 --> 25:40.420
- Xiao Xun. - Xiao Xun.

25:43.460 --> 25:44.060
We should find

25:44.780 --> 25:45.420
the traitor now.

25:48.060 --> 25:48.460
No.

25:50.180 --> 25:51.020
Don't alert them.

25:54.020 --> 25:55.580
To think he could reach Yu

25:55.820 --> 25:57.060
so easily.

25:57.660 --> 25:58.700
The mole will be hard to find.

26:01.260 --> 26:01.660
Yu,

26:02.380 --> 26:03.300
I have an idea.

26:04.220 --> 26:05.820
Since they're disturbing your dreams,

26:06.300 --> 26:07.620
let's play along

26:07.860 --> 26:08.500
and draw them out.

26:09.460 --> 26:09.940
Scared?

26:10.340 --> 26:11.420
Not with you two

26:11.700 --> 26:12.260
here.

26:13.980 --> 26:15.260
Replace the incense.

26:15.940 --> 26:17.420
The Chenxiang incense was too strong.

26:17.740 --> 26:18.540
Change it to a blend

26:18.780 --> 26:20.460
with Fuling and Yuanzhi.

26:21.060 --> 26:22.140
At once, Your Highness.

26:23.820 --> 26:24.740
I've replaced the incense

26:24.740 --> 26:26.220
with Golden Finch Venom.

26:27.180 --> 26:28.620
I knew

26:29.060 --> 26:30.220
you wouldn't leave this matter be.

26:32.900 --> 26:34.460
So, you proposed the sacrifice

26:34.780 --> 26:36.140
in court again.

26:36.140 --> 26:36.620
I

26:37.140 --> 26:38.460
have something to report.

26:38.700 --> 26:39.580
You were certain

26:40.060 --> 26:41.860
Yu would mention the nightmares.

26:42.980 --> 26:44.420
So I played along

26:45.420 --> 26:46.900
with your little show

26:46.900 --> 26:47.900
at the ritual,

26:48.820 --> 26:50.260
to lure you into it.

26:57.060 --> 26:58.700
You poisoned the Chenxiang incense too,

26:58.820 --> 27:00.220
didn't you?

27:01.580 --> 27:01.940
Who

27:02.580 --> 27:03.860
is the mastermind behind this?

27:04.460 --> 27:05.260
His Highness

27:06.580 --> 27:08.620
ordered me to dispose of the ash.​

27:09.420 --> 27:10.820
I truly know nothing.​

27:12.780 --> 27:13.620
Do you think the ash

27:14.500 --> 27:15.780
and a maid's testimony

27:16.980 --> 27:18.820
is enough to pin this on me?

27:19.500 --> 27:20.180
Proof?

27:22.180 --> 27:23.300
Without it,

27:23.940 --> 27:24.700
I could also say

27:25.500 --> 27:27.300
she was coerced

27:27.700 --> 27:28.420
into slandering me.

27:46.300 --> 27:47.300
Does this face look

27:47.700 --> 27:49.060
familiar?

27:49.500 --> 27:50.900
He's from the Office
of the Great Supplicator.

27:51.980 --> 27:53.420
Before the ritual,

27:54.220 --> 27:54.980
I found

27:55.380 --> 27:56.420
that the attendant

27:56.460 --> 27:58.340
preparing the herb wreath

27:59.060 --> 28:00.540
was an impostor.

28:01.100 --> 28:03.020
I intercepted him just in time

28:03.460 --> 28:04.620
and found

28:05.620 --> 28:07.180
a few trinkets on him.

28:30.140 --> 28:31.460
Who sent you?

28:35.700 --> 28:36.260
Speak.

28:37.140 --> 28:38.300
Who is your master?

28:44.060 --> 28:44.620
Talk.

28:46.580 --> 28:48.140
Who ordered this?

28:51.380 --> 28:52.220
Zhao, watch out!

28:59.020 --> 28:59.660
- Yanlai! - Your Highness!

28:59.860 --> 29:02.180
- Your Highness! - Your Highness!

29:06.620 --> 29:07.900
What?

29:34.220 --> 29:34.620
What?

29:35.180 --> 29:37.540
Drawing a blade before the throne.
Insolent fool.

29:40.100 --> 29:41.140
Did you order this?

29:47.380 --> 29:48.140
Overstepping?

29:49.540 --> 29:50.620
Giving orders and drawing swords

29:52.060 --> 29:52.980
instead of His Majesty?

29:53.500 --> 29:54.500
Killing in the court?

29:54.820 --> 29:55.300
What?

29:55.740 --> 29:56.500
Am I the next?

29:57.420 --> 29:58.300
You're eyeing

29:58.740 --> 30:00.100
the Crown, aren't you?

30:00.300 --> 30:01.380
Please hold your tongue.

30:01.780 --> 30:02.380
That attendant

30:02.740 --> 30:05.180
was killed on the spot.

30:06.300 --> 30:07.020
Dead men tell no tales.

30:07.980 --> 30:08.740
You all claim

30:09.420 --> 30:12.020
he was the one who poisoned the herbs,

30:12.820 --> 30:14.260
yet His Majesty is clearly unharmed.

30:14.980 --> 30:15.540
Very well.

30:16.460 --> 30:17.700
If so,

30:18.220 --> 30:20.300
then why did His Majesty feign poisoning

30:20.900 --> 30:21.900
at the ritual

30:22.060 --> 30:23.700
and cause the officials
to worry in vain?

30:26.100 --> 30:26.860
This is outrageous.

30:27.260 --> 30:29.140
His Majesty has been played

30:29.620 --> 30:30.580
by a mere woman.

30:31.100 --> 30:32.780
What becomes of our nation's dignity?

30:33.460 --> 30:36.460
From the coronation
to ruling from behind the curtain,

30:36.860 --> 30:37.820
her ambitions

30:37.940 --> 30:40.780
to seize the throne
could not be clearer.

30:41.220 --> 30:44.620
- Chu Zhao's treason demands her death.
- Chu Zhao's treason demands her death.

30:44.820 --> 30:48.180
- Chu Zhao's treason demands her death.
- Chu Zhao's treason demands her death.

30:48.660 --> 30:50.220
Chu Zhao's treason...

30:50.740 --> 30:52.060
Silence!

30:54.460 --> 30:56.220
The Grand Princess has only ever sought
to ease my burdens.

30:56.940 --> 30:59.540
To say she has given her all
would be an understatement.

31:00.420 --> 31:02.660
To claim she manipulates me
from the shadows

31:03.260 --> 31:04.460
is sheer nonsense.

31:06.100 --> 31:06.940
From the day my incense

31:07.140 --> 31:08.420
was first tampered with,

31:09.380 --> 31:10.860
I knew

31:11.180 --> 31:12.180
there was a traitor

31:12.700 --> 31:14.100
plotting against me.

31:15.020 --> 31:15.940
Feigning the poisoning

31:16.180 --> 31:17.020
was my own idea.

31:18.140 --> 31:19.900
She only acted on my orders

31:20.340 --> 31:21.540
and has done nothing wrong.

31:22.180 --> 31:23.300
If any of you have objections,

31:23.900 --> 31:25.260
lay them before me.

31:25.980 --> 31:26.940
Do not trouble her.

31:28.060 --> 31:28.460
Your Majesty,

31:28.860 --> 31:29.500
you are still young,

31:30.260 --> 31:31.300
unaware of the world's cruelty.​​

31:31.500 --> 31:32.300
I know

31:32.460 --> 31:33.700
who wishes me well.​​

31:34.780 --> 31:36.300
Given our blood ties,

31:36.820 --> 31:37.260
Uncle,

31:37.740 --> 31:38.340
for the days to come,

31:38.820 --> 31:40.140
rest at your estate.

31:40.660 --> 31:41.460
No court for now.

31:52.820 --> 31:53.340
Yes,

31:54.260 --> 31:54.780
Your Majesty.

31:56.980 --> 31:58.140
Hear my command.

31:58.860 --> 31:59.660
Anyone else

32:00.220 --> 32:01.900
plotting treason

32:02.660 --> 32:03.740
shall be executed!

32:07.100 --> 32:08.580
Mr. Deng, Mr. Xie,

32:09.020 --> 32:09.860
do you concur?​​

32:11.060 --> 32:12.180
Your Majesty is wise.

32:12.820 --> 32:15.580
We abide by your will.

32:16.460 --> 32:18.540
- Your Majesty is wise.
- Your Majesty is wise.

32:19.220 --> 32:19.820
Alright.

32:20.500 --> 32:21.420
That concludes today's matter.

32:22.300 --> 32:22.980
Uncle,

32:23.460 --> 32:24.100
you may leave.

33:11.740 --> 33:12.620
Do you find me

33:12.660 --> 33:13.580
ridiculous as well?

33:17.940 --> 33:18.980
You grew up in the desert,

33:20.620 --> 33:21.300
so you must know

33:23.220 --> 33:23.820
the first time a wolf

33:23.900 --> 33:24.980
tears into its prey,

33:26.340 --> 33:27.380
it chokes on the stench of blood.

33:30.260 --> 33:30.940
But it

33:32.380 --> 33:33.100
never lets its prey

33:33.220 --> 33:34.220
see the tremble of its own.

33:35.620 --> 33:36.340
Thank you

33:38.340 --> 33:39.500
for saving me.

33:43.180 --> 33:43.820
It was you

33:44.780 --> 33:45.660
who saved me.

33:47.620 --> 33:48.140
Don't pick up

33:49.740 --> 33:50.580
a blade ever again.

33:52.820 --> 33:53.300
Let me.

34:12.100 --> 34:12.420
No.

34:19.860 --> 34:20.220
No.

34:23.540 --> 34:24.500
If you don't want

34:26.900 --> 34:28.740
to end up dead,

34:31.020 --> 34:32.940
you must strike first.

34:45.220 --> 34:45.900
I told you

34:47.460 --> 34:49.220
I only did it

34:52.300 --> 34:54.020
to survive.

35:06.220 --> 35:07.220
I kill

35:07.780 --> 35:09.220
so that more people

35:09.580 --> 35:10.380
may live!

35:12.460 --> 35:13.820
What does Article Three
of the regulations say?

35:16.460 --> 35:17.100
Suspects

35:18.660 --> 35:20.180
must be handed over
to the court-martial.

35:20.380 --> 35:21.580
Why did you attack him?

35:22.900 --> 35:24.620
He snuck into your tent.

35:25.420 --> 35:26.740
He has to be a spy.

35:26.940 --> 35:27.980
The Army Physician told me

35:29.020 --> 35:30.060
he came to beg for medicine

35:30.580 --> 35:31.620
for his sick child.

35:31.860 --> 35:33.180
Do you know you nearly killed

35:33.220 --> 35:34.260
an innocent soul?

35:38.700 --> 35:40.140
In such tumultuous times,

35:41.020 --> 35:42.860
innocence is but a cloak we wear.

35:44.020 --> 35:44.540
General,

35:45.140 --> 35:46.180
your military achievements

35:46.980 --> 35:48.140
and the path you tread

35:49.260 --> 35:49.980
are built upon the bodies

35:49.980 --> 35:50.940
of these "innocents."

35:51.780 --> 35:52.500
We both waded

35:52.540 --> 35:54.060
through rivers of blood.

35:55.380 --> 35:57.100
Please spare me your talk of mercy.

36:01.460 --> 36:02.700
Have you seen

36:03.100 --> 36:04.300
this ravaged world

36:04.700 --> 36:05.900
and the lives struggling

36:05.900 --> 36:06.740
through the fires of war?

36:07.420 --> 36:08.660
Every campaign I fought

36:10.260 --> 36:11.100
was to safeguard

36:11.100 --> 36:12.340
the hearths and homes of this land.

36:12.780 --> 36:13.980
But if I kill the innocent

36:14.260 --> 36:15.340
out of mere suspicion,

36:15.620 --> 36:16.420
then everything

36:16.460 --> 36:17.300
I've sacrificed to protect

36:17.580 --> 36:18.580
loses all meaning.

36:21.140 --> 36:22.020
He's merely a father,

36:22.060 --> 36:23.460
desperate to save his daughter,

36:23.620 --> 36:24.980
who nearly died at your hand.

36:25.860 --> 36:26.460
Tell me.

36:27.540 --> 36:28.500
Is he innocent or not?

36:30.460 --> 36:31.100
Remember.

36:32.020 --> 36:32.940
Amidst this chaos,

36:33.900 --> 36:34.940
our hearts must hold firm.

36:36.020 --> 36:36.860
I wage war

36:37.660 --> 36:38.980
so that more

36:39.300 --> 36:40.140
may live!

36:54.860 --> 36:56.660
What was on your mind?

36:58.260 --> 36:58.980
I just found out

37:02.780 --> 37:03.820
you're just like your father.

37:08.300 --> 37:08.780
So dull.

37:12.700 --> 37:13.740
Look who's talking.

37:17.700 --> 37:18.140
Fine.

37:19.740 --> 37:20.820
Bore as he is,

37:22.220 --> 37:23.420
his record on the battlefield

37:23.580 --> 37:24.460
is legendary.

37:26.420 --> 37:27.260
Unlike someone

37:28.980 --> 37:29.980
who can barely hold a sword steady.

37:31.020 --> 37:31.900
My father

37:32.500 --> 37:34.060
taught me horseback archery

37:34.060 --> 37:34.860
and swordsmanship himself.

37:35.620 --> 37:36.340
He must've been

37:36.340 --> 37:37.220
a terrible instructor.

37:43.380 --> 37:45.340
I had my mind set on the Capital

37:49.220 --> 37:50.140
and never truly applied myself.

38:02.060 --> 38:02.580
Let me show you.

38:07.620 --> 38:08.100
Ready to learn?

38:29.740 --> 38:33.580
♪Day after day,
across these ancient hills♪

38:33.580 --> 38:37.340
♪Again and again,
the old city cold and still♪

38:37.340 --> 38:40.140
♪Through dust and battle, I look back♪

38:40.140 --> 38:43.380
♪And find you waiting at journey's end♪

38:44.940 --> 38:48.780
♪Night after night, the hours drift on♪

38:48.780 --> 38:52.540
♪Year after year,
our reunions end too soon♪

38:52.540 --> 38:58.120
♪Love so deep, yet fate so thin,
why must it be so hard?♪

38:59.060 --> 39:02.980
♪Through joy and sorrow,
we have shared it all♪

39:02.980 --> 39:06.820
♪Bound by a knowing no words can name♪

39:06.980 --> 39:10.580
♪I'm holding on alone♪

39:10.580 --> 39:14.340
♪Yet across the vast divide♪

39:14.340 --> 39:17.660
♪You feel the ripple too♪

39:38.580 --> 39:39.860
Why are you sweating so much?

39:54.980 --> 39:55.660
Nice work.

39:57.540 --> 39:58.860
I learned from the best, after all.

40:08.980 --> 40:10.260
Your Highness. You should get some rest.

40:30.940 --> 40:31.340
Put this on,

40:32.020 --> 40:32.500
lest you catch a cold.

40:34.940 --> 40:36.100
Is this cloak

40:36.100 --> 40:37.060
so repulsive to you?

41:02.890 --> 41:07.690
♪断墙枯枝残梢 陷泥沼♪

41:07.690 --> 41:10.290
♪偏要撑云霄♪

41:10.290 --> 41:13.860
♪拆下傲骨 血肉成桥♪

41:16.690 --> 41:18.930
♪星火在缝隙煎熬♪

41:18.930 --> 41:20.530
♪烈焰中咆哮♪

41:20.730 --> 41:23.610
♪把寒夜烧出破晓♪

41:23.970 --> 41:26.410
♪命运困我于囚牢♪

41:26.530 --> 41:31.250
♪也不向深渊低头求饶♪

41:31.610 --> 41:35.610
♪总是幽光渺渺 我自桀骜♪

41:35.890 --> 41:39.810
♪蜉蝣欲渡沧海 不问今朝♪

41:40.050 --> 41:44.810
♪不问结局 我亦行我道♪

41:45.490 --> 41:47.210
♪无惧路遥♪

41:47.330 --> 41:50.890
♪流萤生于腐草 也要燃烧♪

41:51.130 --> 41:55.290
♪执剑 冲破天光一道♪

41:55.650 --> 42:00.890
♪让这满身伤痕成为我♪

42:01.010 --> 42:04.410
♪新的骄傲♪

42:18.850 --> 42:21.530
♪宫阙九重暗礁♪

42:22.010 --> 42:24.490
♪只为一人笑♪

42:24.770 --> 42:26.490
♪纷纷扰扰♪

42:26.490 --> 42:32.410
♪人间惊鸿 伴你朝朝♪

42:32.490 --> 42:35.010
♪星火在缝隙煎熬♪

42:35.290 --> 42:36.530
♪烈焰中咆哮♪

42:36.890 --> 42:39.690
♪把寒夜烧出破晓♪

42:40.010 --> 42:42.530
♪命运困我于囚牢♪

42:42.810 --> 42:47.290
♪也不向深渊低头求饶♪

42:47.770 --> 42:51.690
♪总是幽光渺渺 我自桀骜♪

42:51.970 --> 42:55.810
♪蜉蝣欲渡沧海 不问今朝♪

42:56.130 --> 43:00.810
♪不问结局 我亦行我道♪

43:01.610 --> 43:03.210
♪无惧路遥♪

43:03.330 --> 43:06.930
♪流萤生于腐草 也要燃烧♪

43:07.170 --> 43:11.330
♪执剑 冲破天光一道♪

43:11.970 --> 43:16.890
♪让这满身伤痕成为我♪

43:17.330 --> 43:20.410
♪新的骄傲♪
